-- 4. Breakdown — strip rhythm/detail, expose bass structure

-- pull drums and detail
fadeSilence 8 [1,2,3]

d6 $ silence

d10 $ silence

-- simplified, dark bass
d8 $ bassBreak

d9 $ bassAnchor # gain 0.82 # lpf 240

-- keep harmony continuity, thinner (no pads/drones)
d4 $ chordFlow # lpf 1300 # gain 0.76

d5 $ spaceTex # gain 0.62

d7 $ burst # gain 0.7

-- rebuild cue
-- d7 $ riser
-- d7 $ silence
